    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d375">

                <pb facs="0566" n="519" xml:id="pg519"/>

                <head>375. Telegram 1197 from Geneva<anchor n="1" xml:id="d375-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Geneva</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1955-11-17">November 17, 1955, 7
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d375-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d375-1"/>
                <p>1197. From Johnson.</p>
                <p>Before today’s meeting NCNA correspondent was “expressing opinion” to Western
                    correspondents that these talks cannot go on much longer.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Gowen</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
